{"3734690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skyline Bowling", "steam_appid": 3734690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3849970, 3849980, 3849990, 3850000], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734690/extras/d001270daee829238ae4b66542cc4ddc.avif?t=1785924198\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734690/extras/0d3144af3fe382d5001607e34de500f5.poster.avif?t=1785924198\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734690/extras/0d3144af3fe382d5001607e34de500f5.webm?t=1785924198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734690/extras/0d3144af3fe382d5001607e34de500f5.mp4?t=1785924198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an action-packed challenge where every strike brings you closer to victory! Join friends or family in up to four-player matches, compete in thrilling tournaments against top bowlers from across the lanes, and bowl in amazing alleys with cool views. Only the best players make it to the final rounds – will you be the one holding the trophy?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734690/extras/9963c01958ca30bbbe27ec45f03d3847.avif?t=1785924198\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734690/extras/1ee2a4af1da842d1d5c206678454054d.poster.avif?t=1785924198\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734690/extras/1ee2a4af1da842d1d5c206678454054d.webm?t=1785924198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734690/extras/1ee2a4af1da842d1d5c206678454054d.mp4?t=1785924198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Skyline Bowling isn’t just about throwing the ball; it’s about using the right gear and clever strategies! Boost your skills with special gear like gloves that give your ball extra spin or shoes that make it roll faster. Choose from different bowling balls, and earn experience to unlock new tournaments and amazing bowling alleys with fun surprises! Collect skills to help you get even more strikes. Are you ready to bowl your way to the top?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local multiplayer</strong> - Compete against your friends and family in matches for up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Requires at least 2 controllers to play.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Tournaments</strong> - Compete in rounds and aim for the finals, where only the best bowlers make it.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Character</strong> - Personalize your bowler with cool gear, such as gloves and shoes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Arenas</strong> - Unlock amazing new alleys with fun twists as you level up.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Skills</strong> - Use active and passive skills to boost your chances of winning!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to roll, aim, and strike your way to victory in Skyline Bowling!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam